{"primary_contradiction":{"id":"pc-dynamic-visibility-needs-durable-nonauthorizing-state","summary":"同 Run 可见性演进必须成为可恢复可重放且不授予执行权限的独立 durable authority；当前 plan 未闭合 catalog、activation effect、checkpoint 与 Host execution identity 的事务恢复链。","acceptance_ids":["AC-18","AC-20","AC-23"]},"challenge_clusters":[{"cluster_id":"cluster-activation-atomicity","parent_finding_ids":["activation-effect-checkpoint-not-atomic"],"specialty":"failure-recovery","question":"activation handler mutation、effect ledger、context append 与 exposure checkpoint 如何形成可重放 durable commit？","required_evidence":["provider_reserved checkpoint trace","activate crash/reopen SQLite trace","EffectExecutor settlement boundary","ReactCheckpoint/UoW atomic extension feasibility"],"specialist_required":true},{"cluster_id":"cluster-durable-runtime-catalog","parent_finding_ids":["runtime-catalog-durable-shape-and-resolver-missing"],"specialty":"data-state","question":"Runtime catalog 与 Run exposure 的唯一 durable owner/schema/migration/restart resolver 是什么？","required_evidence":["tool_catalog_snapshots schema/path","RunStart and TerminationState compatibility","future-consumer restart","exact restore spike"],"specialist_required":true},{"cluster_id":"cluster-capability-kind-boundary","parent_finding_ids":["heterogeneous-capability-kinds-conflated","skill-body-ingress-and-redaction-contract-undefined"],"specialty":"architecture","question":"统一发现面如何区分 executable Tool、Skill locator/body loader 与 Workflow metadata，并隔离 projection/execution/private context/redaction？","required_evidence":["discriminated public API","Skill next-attempt sequence","Workflow naming check","redaction contract"],"specialist_required":true},{"cluster_id":"cluster-mcp-incarnation-and-race","parent_finding_ids":["mcp-incarnation-not-frozen-per-run"],"specialty":"performance-third-party","question":"什么 immutable MCP incarnation/schema identity 阻止旧 Run 借用热替换 session，并让新 Run 原子看到新 generation？","required_evidence":["lifecycle ordering","registry concurrency","incarnation proposal","race spike"],"specialist_required":true},{"cluster_id":"cluster-black-box-evidence","parent_finding_ids":["manual-oracles-lack-frozen-fixtures"],"specialty":"testability-evidence","question":"CAP-2/CAP-3 要冻结哪些 fixture/locator/hash/expected/readiness facts 才可复现？","required_evidence":["localhost URL/title/origin","Markdown fixture/hash/heading","Skill locator/trace","spike artifacts"],"specialist_required":true},{"cluster_id":"cluster-immutable-release-rollback","parent_finding_ids":["immutable-release-has-no-prepublish-rollback-gate"],"specialty":"release-rollback","question":"如何在一次 immutable publication 前完成 final candidate SDK/Host/UI gate，并在失败时保持或恢复 0.4.0 pin？","required_evidence":["candidate identity chain","prepublish Host gate","tag/source/release sequence","rollback procedure"],"specialist_required":true}]}
